Description: R and Quarto source workflow for the RecWaterVirome study.
    Shared scientific functions, eighteen analysis notebooks, saved-result
    figure production and deterministic supplementary exports follow the
    author-selected BMC clean baseline. Required data inputs are supplied
    separately and hash-registered. Optional original R model and diagnostic
    scripts are provided in dev and are not run by the figure workflow.
